.SS "int get_exit_status (int wstatus)"

.PP
Convert raw waitpid status to shell exit code\&. get exit status from wait status

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Normal exit: WEXITSTATUS (0-255)
.PP

.PP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Killed by signal: 128 + signal number 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIwstatus\fP The waitpid status\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
The shell exit code\&. 
.RE
.PP

.PP

.SS "void split_assignment (const char * assign, char ** name, char ** value)"

.PP
Split "NAME=value" at first '=' into separate name and value strings\&. Caller must free both *name and *value\&.

.PP
If no '=' found, *name = dup of assign, *value = dup of ""\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIassign\fP The assignment string\&. 
.br
\fIname\fP The pointer to store the name\&. 
.br
\fIvalue\fP The pointer to store the value\&. 
.RE
.PP

